00:45:20.900 --> 00:45:22.880
And I had to sit there and be dead serious.

918
00:45:23.060 --> 00:45:24.880
I didn't want to be the guy to mess up the scene.

919
00:45:25.180 --> 00:45:30.420
So working with people who were literally comic geniuses in their delivery and their timing,

920
00:45:30.440 --> 00:45:36.400
having to sit there and being the new guy on set and trying to keep a straight face and not to mess up was a challenge.

921
00:45:36.580 --> 00:45:40.120
But such a life experience.

922
00:45:40.240 --> 00:45:41.700
And just so funny to do.

