00:45:47.960 --> 00:45:48.780
We would do this.

926
00:45:49.000 --> 00:45:52.120
We would know when someone was going to break and we would have a little fun.

927
00:45:52.280 --> 00:45:52.900
We would.

928
00:45:53.040 --> 00:45:53.520
It's true.

