00:46:29.940 --> 00:46:32.520
So I was literally sitting there and something was going on.

941
00:46:32.660 --> 00:46:36.540
And I felt the camera guy who was shooting over my shoulder tap me on the shoulder when

942
00:46:36.540 --> 00:46:37.280
to say my line.

