00:47:45.560 --> 00:47:47.840
And they pointed me in the direction of where the breakfast was.

965
00:47:48.120 --> 00:47:50.320
And as I started walking, I heard someone in the headset go,

966
00:47:51.040 --> 00:47:52.480
cool guy, Paul's going to breakfaSt.

